 excited to try  and give it a shot and see what happened  and it turned out that I fell in love  with it I fell in love with the music I  found on with the people I fell in love  with the community and eventually became  a business opportunity and I'm going to  investor in the largest salsa school  maybe in North America I'm a DJ I  part-time instructor what I want to it's  a lot of fun and it's become a  big part of my life and the people who  are around me are from a lot of them are  from the salsa community so you were  something that I wasn't very good at I  knew nothing about all the odds were  against me and they turned it into a  successful business opportunity but also  something that gives me a lot of  personal fulfillment and was only by  exploring my passion at the same time I  things I tried ballroom dancing I tried  rock climbing and and those things  weren't interesting for me those things  weren't exciting for me and so I stopped  like rock climbing I went once tried it  out didn't like it  that I'm done with rock climbing for  some people it's great it's just not for  me  some of the things that I picked up I  picked up snowboarding recently and you  know when I first learned it I was going  almost every day big learning curve  loved it now I still like it but it's  not a deep-seated passion like I can't  wait to get on the snowboarding Hill  again right so that's not going to be  something I'm going to build a business  around at least not yet and so you'll  find that some things you try and and  you know you don't like and so you stop  and some things you try for a while you  do like them and then it starts to fade  and so that's not something that you're  going to build a business around either  you got to find the things that you love  doing that you wake up you're excited to  do that's when you can build a business  around get really good at and also help  other people when you find that you know  you've hit the mark and until then have  the courage to keep exploring because  it's hard it's hard when you don't know  what you want to do and you feel like  this next thing has to be the thing that  gets me everything right you put so much  pressure and everything you feel like a  total failure from bouncing from one  thing to another  but it's important part of your journey  in your process and when you find it as  with all matters of the heart you'll  know and that's the opportunity to run  after believe those you watch the video  thumbs up below leave a comment ask the  question below those means so much to me  it keeps me going every day and if you  want to see videos like this click on my  face subscribe to the channel thank you  so much I'll see you soon  you
 

